MireDay: The Mire becomes enshrouded in a heavy fog when the sun rises. Without a lantern, you won't be able to see a thing!
InfernoNight: When night falls, smoldering ash rains down from the Inferno's volcano. Without protective gear, you'll be burnt alive!
Lovecraftian: If you slay something eldritch, something even more eldritch might just be waiting for you...
Hoard: They say a sprawling hoard of treasure lies beneath Terraria, but none who've sought it out have lived to tell the tale.
Acropolis: They say that high in the sky, the home of seraphs can be found. Though apparently they aren't very nice.
Anubis: The Legendscribe can point you in the right direction if you find yourself lost on what to do next.
AncientsAwaken: Defeating a truly powerful foe might just cause Ancient forces to Awaken!
Void: In the furthest reaches of space, an ominous collection of islands can be found... Perhaps it'd be best to leave them undisturbed.
Awakening: Stronger foes may not show you their true power unless you're truly an Expert.
GoblinSlayer: There's a steel-clad warrior who's bested countless invasions. He might even be willing to part with some of his spoils for the right price.
ChaosBiomes: There were once two towns: one beneath a volcano, and one next to a lake. However one day, their gods unleashed chaos; destroying the towns.
